Last month, @WaysandMeansGOP released IRS whistleblower‘s testimony on Hunter Biden’s tax evasion. 

Today, @GOPoversight is holding the IRS accountable by hearing from the whistleblowers on the special  treatment of the Biden family.

@HouseGOP will bring Hunter to justice.

It’s imperative Congress takes steps to improve kidney disease prevention, education, & treatment.

@RepTerriSewell & I introduced the Chronic Kidney Disease Improvement and Treatment Act which addresses these issues & more.

Read our op-ed with @rollcall⬇️https://t.co/gvxTtfVCcS

Cancer is a horrific disease that has impacted many lives. Medicare beneficiaries should be able to have access to early screenings.

@RepTerriSewell’s bill is an important stepping stone in providing coverage for multi-cancer early detection screening. 

